@host = http://localhost:5141

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Status summary (JSON)
GET {{host}}/api/status

### Status page (HTML)
GET {{host}}/

### Create a monitor
POST {{host}}/api/monitors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Example", "url": "https://example.com", "intervalSeconds": 60, "failureThreshold": 2 }

@id = 1

### List monitors (with 24h uptime)
GET {{host}}/api/monitors

### Monitor detail (checks, incidents, 24h/7d stats)
GET {{host}}/api/monitors/{{id}}

### Run a check right now
POST {{host}}/api/monitors/{{id}}/check

### Recent checks
GET {{host}}/api/monitors/{{id}}/checks?limit=50

### Incidents
GET {{host}}/api/monitors/{{id}}/incidents

### Update a monitor
PUT {{host}}/api/monitors/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Example", "url": "https://example.com", "intervalSeconds": 120, "enabled": true }

### Delete a monitor
DELETE {{host}}/api/monitors/{{id}}
